<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <record id="salary_breakup_report" model="ir.actions.report">
        <field name="name">Salary Breakup Report</field>
        <field name="model">hr.applicant</field>
        <field name="report_type">qweb-pdf</field>
        <field name="report_name">hr_extended.print_salary_breakup</field>
        <field name="report_file">hr_extended.print_salary_breakup</field>
        <field name="print_report_name">'%s' % (object.partner_name)</field>
        <field name="binding_model_id" ref="hr_extended.model_hr_applicant"/>
        <field name="binding_type">report</field>
    </record>

    <template id="print_salary_breakup">
        <t t-call="web.basic_layout">
            <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="doc">
                <div class="page">
                    <p>Dear Mr/Ms<t t-esc="doc.partner_name"/>,
                    </p>
                    <p><b>Greetings from Ekara Partnership</b>.
                    </p>
                    <p>Further to the discussion we held with you regarding the compensation, we are delighted to extend
                        this offer of employment with us.
                    </p>
                    <p>Please find the below details of Designation &amp; basic Terms and Conditions of your employment,
                        for your kind consideration.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <b>Position:</b>
                        <t t-esc="doc.job_id.name"/>
                        <br/>
                        <b>Job Level:</b>
                        <t t-esc="doc.grade_job_level_id.name"/>
                        <br/>
                        <b>Department:</b>
                        <t t-esc="doc.department_id.name"/>
                        <br/>
                        <b>Work Location:</b>
                        <t t-esc="doc.location_id.name"/>
                        <br/>
                    </p>

                    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">
                        <!--                        <tr>-->
                        <!--                            <td colspan="3" style="padding: 10px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">-->
                        <!--                                <div style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; margin-bottom: 10px;">-->
                        <!--                                    ANNEXURE-->
                        <!--                                </div>-->
                        <!--                                <div style="margin-bottom: 5px;">-->
                        <!--                                    <b>Name:</b>-->
                        <!--                                    <span t-esc="doc.partner_name or 'N/A'"/>-->
                        <!--                                </div>-->
                        <!--                                <div>-->
                        <!--                                    <b>Designation:</b>-->
                        <!--                                    <span t-esc="doc.name or 'N/A'"/>-->
                        <!--                                </div>-->
                        <!--                            </td>-->
                        <!--                        </tr>-->
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="3"
                                style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; padding: 10px;">
                                <b>Salary Structure with effect from
                                    <t t-esc="doc.availability"/>
                                </b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; background-color: #add8e6;">
                                <b>Particulars</b>
                            </td>
                            <td style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; background-color: #add8e6;">
                                <b>Per Annum</b>
                            </td>
                            <td style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; background-color: #add8e6;">
                                <b>Per Month</b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="3" style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold;">Part - A
                                (Fixed Pay)
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000;">Basic and DA</td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(doc.basic_da or 0.0)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(round(doc.basic_da / 12))"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000;">House Rent Allowance</td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(doc.house_rent_allowance or 0.0)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(round(doc.house_rent_allowance / 12))"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000;">Special Allowance</td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(doc.special_allowance or 0.0)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(round(doc.special_allowance / 12))"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6;">
                                Sub-total (Part A)
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6; text-align: right">
                                <t t-set="a_annual_subtotal"
                                   t-value="(doc.basic_da or 0.0)+ (doc.house_rent_allowance or 0.0)+ (doc.special_allowance or 0.0)"/>
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(a_annual_subtotal)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6; text-align: right">
                                <t t-set="a_monthly_subtotal"
                                   t-value="(round(doc.basic_da / 12)) + (round(doc.house_rent_allowance / 12)) + (round(doc.special_allowance / 12))"/>
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(a_monthly_subtotal)"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <!-- Details: Part B -->
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="3" style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold;">
                                Part – B (Statutory Payments)
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000;">Statutory Bonus</td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format((doc.stat_bonus_amount or 0.0) * 12)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(doc.stat_bonus_amount or 0.0)"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000;">Provident Fund (Employer's
                                Contribution)
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format((doc.provident_fund or 0.0) * 12)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(doc.provident_fund or 0.0)"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000;">ESIC (Employer's Contribution)</td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format((doc.esi_amount or 0.0) * 12)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(doc.esi_amount or 0.0)"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6;">
                                Sub-total (Part B)
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6; text-align: right">
                                <t t-set="annual_subtotal"
                                   t-value="(doc.stat_bonus_amount or 0.0) * 12 + (doc.provident_fund or 0.0) * 12 + (doc.esi_amount or 0.0) * 12"/>
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(annual_subtotal)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6; text-align: right">
                                <t t-set="monthly_subtotal"
                                   t-value="(doc.stat_bonus_amount or 0.0) + (doc.provident_fund or 0.0) + (doc.esi_amount or 0.0)"/>
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(monthly_subtotal)"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>


                        <!-- Details: Part C -->
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="3" style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold;">Part – C
                                (Variable Pay)
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000;">Store Performance Incentive</td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-set="annual_store_performance_incentive"
                                   t-value="doc.annual_store_performance_incentive or 0.0"/>
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(annual_store_performance_incentive)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(round(annual_store_performance_incentive / 12))"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000;">Monthly Performance Incentive</td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-set="monthly_performance_incentive"
                                   t-value="doc.monthly_performance_incentive or 0.0"/>
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(monthly_performance_incentive)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(round(monthly_performance_incentive / 12))"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000;">Variable Pay</td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-set="variable_pay_amount" t-value="doc.variable_pay_amount or 0.0"/>
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(variable_pay_amount)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(round(variable_pay_amount / 12))"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000;">Performance Linked Pay</td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-set="annual_performance_linked_pay"
                                   t-value="doc.annual_performance_linked_pay or 0.0"/>
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(annual_performance_linked_pay)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(round(annual_performance_linked_pay / 12))"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6;">
                                Sub-total (Part C)
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6; text-align: right">
                                <t t-set="subtotal_c"
                                   t-value="annual_store_performance_incentive + monthly_performance_incentive + variable_pay_amount + annual_performance_linked_pay"/>
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(subtotal_c)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(round(annual_store_performance_incentive / 12 + monthly_performance_incentive / 12 + variable_pay_amount / 12 + annual_performance_linked_pay / 12))"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>

                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6;">
                                TOTAL SALARY (A + B + C)
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format((doc.basic_da or 0.0) +
                                 (doc.house_rent_allowance or 0.0) +
                                 (doc.special_allowance or 0.0) +
                                (doc.stat_bonus_amount or 0.0) * 12 +
                                (doc.provident_fund or 0.0) * 12 +
                                (doc.esi_amount or 0.0) * 12 +
                                (doc.annual_store_performance_incentive or 0.0) +
                                (doc.monthly_performance_incentive or 0.0) +
                                (doc.variable_pay_amount or 0.0) +
                                (doc.annual_performance_linked_pay or 0.0))"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(round((doc.basic_da or 0.0) / 12) +
                                 round((doc.house_rent_allowance or 0.0) / 12) +
                                 round((doc.special_allowance or 0.0) / 12)  +
                                (doc.stat_bonus_amount or 0) +
                                (doc.provident_fund or 0) +
                                (doc.esi_amount or 0) +
                                round((doc.annual_store_performance_incentive or 0.0) / 12) +
                                round((doc.monthly_performance_incentive or 0.0) / 12) +
                                round((doc.variable_pay_amount or 0.0) / 12) +
                                round((doc.annual_performance_linked_pay or 0.0) / 12))"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>

                        <!-- Details: Part D -->
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="3" style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold;">Part D
                                (Other Benefits)
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000;">Medical Insurance**</td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(doc.medical_insurance or 0.0)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">-</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000;">Group Personal Accidental Insurance***
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(doc.group_personal_accident_insurance or 0.0)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">-</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000;">Solis Health Benefit Beacon Plan****
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(doc.solis_health_benefit_beacon_plan or 0.0)"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: right">-</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6;">
                                Sub-total (Part D)
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format((doc.medical_insurance or 0.0) + (doc.group_personal_accident_insurance or 0.0) + (doc.solis_health_benefit_beacon_plan or 0.0))"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6; text-align: right">
                                -
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6;">
                                Total Cost to the Company (A + B + C + D)
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format((doc.basic_da or 0.0) +
                                 (doc.house_rent_allowance or 0.0) +
                                 (doc.special_allowance or 0.0) +
                                (doc.stat_bonus_amount or 0.0) * 12 +
                                (doc.provident_fund or 0.0) * 12 +
                                (doc.esi_amount or 0.0) * 12 +
                                (doc.annual_store_performance_incentive or 0.0) +
                                (doc.monthly_performance_incentive or 0.0) +
                                (doc.variable_pay_amount or 0.0) +
                                (doc.annual_performance_linked_pay or 0.0) +
                                (doc.medical_insurance or 0.0) +
                                (doc.group_personal_accident_insurance or 0.0) +
                                (doc.solis_health_benefit_beacon_plan or 0.0) )"/>
                            </td>
                            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; background-color: #add8e6; text-align: right">
                                <t t-esc="'{:,}'.format(round((doc.basic_da or 0.0) / 12) +
                                 round((doc.house_rent_allowance or 0.0) / 12) +
                                 round((doc.special_allowance or 0.0) / 12) +
                                (doc.stat_bonus_amount or 0) +
                                (doc.provident_fund or 0) +
                                (doc.esi_amount or 0) +
                                round((doc.annual_store_performance_incentive or 0.0) / 12) +
                                round((doc.monthly_performance_incentive or 0.0) / 12) +
                                round((doc.variable_pay_amount or 0.0) / 12) +
                                round((doc.annual_performance_linked_pay or 0.0) / 12) +
                                round((doc.medical_insurance or 0.0) / 12) +
                                round((doc.group_personal_accident_insurance or 0.0) / 12) +
                                round((doc.solis_health_benefit_beacon_plan or 0.0) /12))"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>

                    </table>
                    <div style="font-family: Times New Roman, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 20px;">
                        <p>
                            <b>Variable pay payable as per the policy of the company</b>
                            <br/>
                            <b>**Medical and Accidental Insurance applicable as per the company policy</b>
                            <br/>
                            <b>***Apart from the above, you will be eligible for gratuity, leave, and other benefits as
                                per
                                the company policy
                            </b>
                            <br/>
                        </p>

                        <ol>
                            <li>This offer is contingent on you agreeing to join the Company and clearing the background
                                checks and reference verifications by on or before
                                <b>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.verification_date"/>
                                </b>
                                .
                            </li>
                            <br/>
                            <li>Prior to the start of your employment with the Company, you will be required to submit
                                to the Company a list of documents as detailed below to help conduct background checks
                                and verifications. Your employment with the Company shall be contingent on you clearing
                                any such checks and/or verifications.
                            </li>
                            <br/>
                            <li>For the first six (6) months of your employment you will be placed in probation. Post
                                the successful completion of your probation period you will receive a written
                                confirmation. This probation period may be extended if your performance is not
                                satisfactory.
                            </li>
                            <br/>
                            <li>Your indicative compensation will be as mentioned above inclusive of all taxes and
                                benefits. Please refer annexure for detailed breakup.
                            </li>
                            <br/>
                            <li>Upon acceptance of this offer, and execution of the Appointment Letter, you will be
                                subject to all the Company’s internal policies.
                            </li>
                            <br/>
                            <li>Please execute and return this document to us if you wish to accept this offer of
                                employment.
                            </li>
                            <br/>
                            <li>This is an official E-mail Offer.</li>
                        </ol>

                        <p>We hope that you'll accept this job offer and look forward to welcoming you aboard.</p>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </t>
        </t>
    </template>
</odoo>
